The Switch 2 protocol code in this folder (GATT layout, command handlers,
simulated flash contents, pairing and report format) is ported from
ESP32-BLE5-NSController-Emulator
(https://github.com/2017fighting/ESP32-BLE5-NSController-Emulator, commit
657853dccf9476a134192a775ec8d3d9d31dd5e3), which is based on
https://github.com/ndeadly/switch2_controller_research. Its licence:

